  "description": "Ha Jeong-min, an ordinary guy in his thirties with neither money nor hope, finds himself at the very depths of misery after a car crash leaves him able to see nothing but “male ghosts”.\n\nBut they say you should turn a crisis into an opportunity. Just as he’s making a name for himself by helping aggrieved male ghosts find peace through his own body, he runs into Kang Seung-hyuk, his high school crush. And what’s more, it’s all part of his “exorcism business”! But...\n\n*Ghost A: “I want some mutually consensual, love-filled ♥sexy time♥, darling.”*\n\n*Ghost B: “Ooooh\\~ Mummy, I’m sooo thirsty\\~ aww♥”*\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000079854)",
